      "lineRange": [47, 319],
      "summary": "定时器调度器核心类，管理 TimerWheel 实例和 ThreadPool，提供 Schedule/ScheduleRecurring/Cancel/Pause/Resume/Stop/Post 等完整定时任务生命周期管理接口。",
      "tags": ["scheduler", "timer", "service", "concurrency"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
